WEBVTT

00:04:29.181 --> 00:04:32.435
presumably you get lots of social media
messages, lots of everything,

00:04:32.476 --> 00:04:34.228
and maybe some of them are negative.

00:04:34.228 --> 00:04:35.688
How do you cope?

00:04:35.730 --> 00:04:39.608
VN: Well, I want to first of all
say that, you know,

00:04:39.650 --> 00:04:41.861
I'm not the voice of Africa,

00:04:41.902 --> 00:04:44.363
yeah, there are so many --

00:04:44.405 --> 00:04:46.032
MR: You are one of the voices.

00:04:46.073 --> 00:04:47.325
VN: Yes.

00:04:47.616 --> 00:04:53.664
And the publicity or the fame,
if I should say that,

00:04:53.664 --> 00:04:54.915
comes with that.

00:04:54.915 --> 00:04:58.210
It can be both positive and also negative.

00:04:58.544 --> 00:05:01.172
And negative, it can be, you know,